the game awards had some major reveals  you can play the matrix awakens unreal  engine demo now and more  the game awards 2021 featured several  big game announcements and some  unexpected surprises as well as some  much anticipated first looks at  previously announced projects now let's  talk about some of the biggest ones the  wonder woman was one of the first  surprises from the game awards 2021 and  is a new game created by monolith the  studio behind the nemesis powered middle  earth shadow of mordor and shadow of war  games little is known about the game at  the moment but the studio's reputation  speaks for itself when it comes to  crafting living breathing open worlds  developed by rocksteady games of batman  arkham fame suicide squad killed the  justice league was previously revealed  with a pre-rendered trailer however we  got our first look at gameplay during  the game awards 2021. the footage showed  harley quinn deadshot and several other  villains fighting the flash who seems to  be mind controlled and not really  feeling like himself the game is  scheduled to launch in 2022 the  long-awaited sequel alan wake 2 was  finally revealed by remedy entertainment  and this time it's going to be less  psychological thriller and more full-on  survival horror creative director sam  lake and team last made control which  made narrative connections between the  two games and it's quite possible we'll  see this expanded on in allen wick 2.  both previous allen weight games were  xbox exclusives though alan wake was  later released as a remastered game on  other platforms set in the high republic  around 200 years before luke skywalker  star wars eclipse looks to be a  different sort of star wars game and not  just because it's exploring a period we  haven't seen in other games it's  developed by quantic dream which is  known for its narrative focused  adventure games rather than action or  shooter titles how this will exactly  play out remains to be seen but the  light side and dark side concept seems  perfect for a morality system we also  got our first look at sinowa saga  hellblade 2. the gameplay was captured  the week prior to the show and looks  incredible so good that the viewers had  to be reminded before and after the  trailer that they were in fact seeing  gameplay and not cinematics only the  trailer showcases protagonist sinua  working together with a group of  warriors to take down a truly large  being of seemingly mythical origins like  the first game hellblade cinema  sacrifice it's best to experience this  new trailer with headphones on the  voices at aids cinewa speak throughout  the trailer though soft enough that it's  hard to hear them without headphones  there were plenty of reveals and  announcements and if you missed it then  be sure to check out our channel for all  of the best trailers from the show the  full replay and more  the matrix awakens is a free unreal  engine 5 experience designed to show off  the power of the engine and the  quote-unquote future of interactive  storytelling and it's now available on  both the xbox series xns and the ps5 it  was released during the game awards and  the experience was written by series  co-creator lonnie wachowski and of  course stars reeves and moss the two  appear as old versions of their matrix  characters neil and trinity albeit with  something fishy going on to explain how  they're you know alive  after a never before seen clip teased a  bit of this months of the matrix  resurrections the pair introduced the  free experience and announced that it  was already available less than a fully  fledged game the tech demo is meant to  highlight the heights now within reach  for something like unreal engine 5. just  this week epic's crown jewel fortnite  moved over to unreal engine 5 with the  launch of fortnite chapter 3. the matrix  awakens is an open world experience and  was created in collaboration between  epic games and warner brothers and comes  just weeks before the matrix  resurrections hits theaters and hbo max  on december 22nd  and speaking of new things that are now  live phasmophobia has released another  new update cursed possessions is both  the name of the new update and the name  of the new items being added to the game  these items are going to give players an  additional objective in exchange for  some information each location will  feature one of six of these new items  which are randomly chosen at the start  of each contract the new items include a  music box that paranormal entities sing  along to a tortured voodoo doll that you  can put a pin in that triggers a  reaction from the ghost a summoning  circle where you can temporarily trap a  ghost and more luigi board is now  considered a cursed possession and has  also gotten a few changes make sure you  actually say goodbye to the board or  you're going to face some consequences  along with the new cursed possessions  there is also a new ghost type the mimic  which is said to be the most intriguing  ghost type we've ever encountered has  been added to the list the mimic's  description in the journal says it's an  elusive mysterious copycat ghost that  mimics traits and behaviors from others  including other ghosts  there are also a number of other various  changes and bug fixes that you can see  on the full list on the game steam page  so what did you think of the game awards  and were there any games you were hoping  to see more of and you didn't let me  know in the comments below and make sure  you leave a like and subscribe so you  don't miss the latest in gaming news  happy friday everyone and have a great  weekend  [Music]
 

